          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p><span class=\"accent\">It took me two days to arrive here. Mountains were steep. The leaves kept hitting my skin. My feet were bleeding. Running, chasing, yet one goes on forgetting.</span></p>",
          "htmlZh": "<p><span class=\"accent\">我花了两天才来到这里。山很陡。树叶不停地打在我的皮肤上。我的脚在流血。奔跑，追逐，人却一路不断地遗忘。</span></p>"
